<title>USA: Univ. of Alabama BOT, $19.650, won by JC Bradford.</title>
<headline>Univ. of Alabama BOT, $19.650, won by JC Bradford.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>J.C. Brandford &amp; Co. said it won $19.650 million of University of Alabama BOT, general fee revenue bonds, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 4.79 percent.</p>
